        <!-- 5. I7 (CORRECTED mechanic - see README.md and this plan's own
             TestPlan-level comment for why the task brief's original
             ledger_entry-count mechanic was unimplementable):
             DeliveryService's own dedup gate (seenJobIds, added by Task 26)
